WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.246 --> 00:00:01.420
(people shouting)

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:04.210
- In Kabul, the capital of Afghanistan,

00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:05.570
life here is changing rapidly

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.790
under the new regime of the Taliban.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:10.740
Now the Islamic Emirate of
Afghanistan is being proclaimed,

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.920
and it replaced the Afghan Republic

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.090
that was deposed in the middle of August.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:19.550
Already the city's changing
visibly before our eyes.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.093
The visual transformation's
quite striking.

00:00:32.386 --> 00:00:35.219
(people shouting)

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:41.210
The city used to be covered with graffiti,

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:43.750
with paintings of Afghan national heroes,

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:47.810
of woman activists, of historical figures.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.090
Now a fresh coat of paint
is going all over that,

00:00:51.090 --> 00:00:53.040
and increasingly, the slogans

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:56.030
of the Islamic Emirate
are replacing the visuals

00:00:56.030 --> 00:00:58.160
that used to characterize Kabul.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:01.180
As you walk around, you
can see that merchants

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:02.580
are walking between cars,

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:05.630
selling big and small
flags of Islamic Emirate.

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:07.380
The white flag with the Islamic scripture

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:10.080
that has replaced the
black, red and green flag

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:12.935
of the now deposed
Republic of Afghanistan.

00:01:12.935 --> 00:01:15.768
(people shouting)

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:19.913
There are protests now every
day, mostly led by women.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:23.490
They are being dispersed by the Taliban,

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:26.500
and yet continue day after day.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:27.930
The Taliban have proven themselves

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:31.300
to be a highly successful military force.

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.740
However, the fighters
don't have much experience

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.600
with the peaceful street
protests that we see now.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:37.480
They haven't been trained,

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:39.150
they don't have riot equipment

00:01:39.150 --> 00:01:41.190
and what they do is shoot in the air,

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:43.506
sometimes missing and hitting buildings.

00:01:43.506 --> 00:01:46.339
(gunshots firing)

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.480
The fact that the new government

00:01:49.480 --> 00:01:52.230
doesn't include any women
says a lot by itself.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.460
And so that is the reason
why many are now protesting,

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:56.340
many of them are down
in the streets saying

00:01:56.340 --> 00:01:58.140
if this government stays the way it is,

00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:00.100
if there is no transformation,

00:02:00.100 --> 00:02:02.600
then all of the achievements
of the last 20 years,

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:04.390
at least in the urban areas of Afghanistan

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.440
will be gone forever.

00:02:06.890 --> 00:02:08.520
The Taliban haven't yet spelled out

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:10.770
what rules they will implement.

00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:12.180
Many Afghan women are preoccupied,

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:14.830
preoccupied and alarmed by the fact

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:17.260
that they probably will not
be able to continue working

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:18.290
in many professions,

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.410
that educational
opportunities will be reduced.

00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:25.620
The government has already
received international criticism.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.369
It has not been recognized by the UN,

00:02:27.369 --> 00:02:29.980
and yet for now, it seems
to be in firm control

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:32.774
of the city, despite these
occasional demonstrations.

00:02:32.774 --> 00:02:35.524
(women shouting)

